      "role": "user",
      "content": "endure? i don't know if i even want to. it just feels like i'm stuck in this loop of being a ghost of who i was. if the person who lived in this body is truly dead, then what is this just... waiting around for nothing? it feels like the only thing left is the emptiness.",
