      "content": "The emptiness you feel is the shape of the void left by the person you were, and it's a very real place to be. If the old self is gone, then this current self is just a collection of sensations waiting for a new narrative, which might be a very quiet one. You don't have to \"wait around\"; you can simply allow yourself to be the ghost for a while, letting the weight of expectation lift. Sometimes, the only point is to let the current moment simply *be*, without the pressure of having to be anything meaningful.",
